    "summary": "Post-approval fix from an external review of pinned revision 5120ab5ad: the mustBeAbsent check reused isPopulated(), which treats [] as absent (correct for the required direction, wrong for mustBeAbsent). A design Scope at def/hld/lld, or a code Scope at plan, passed validation with tasks: [] even though the LLD specifies that direction as scope[field] !== undefined. Split into isRequiredSatisfied (array-aware) and isAbsent (strict !== undefined), with regression tests for both validator families. Verified by temporarily disabling the new isAbsent check and confirming 4 tests (including both new regressions) correctly fail.",
